# The technician's tools, storage and tanks.
ent-WFAdminTechBox = subspace box
    .desc = A hand manufactured storage container composed of rare alloys and with exotic processes. Stores an ungodly amount of anything. Your oversized Xeno wife will fit in this. Its a box shaped bag of holding on cocaine. Reality warping recursion issues not included.
ent-WFAdminTechCarbine = subspace carbine
    .desc = A Hoshi carbine that came back from CentCom with a cell that never runs down.
ent-WFAdminTechConstructionBagBluespace = bluespace construction bag
    .desc = An artisinally crafted pocket liner utilizing advanced technologies, techniques, and materials. Peeking inside the pocket, cherenkov-esque radiation illuminates a mass of materials and supplies.
ent-WFAdminTechConstructionBagSubspace = subspace construction bag
    .desc = An artisinally crafted pocket liner utilizing advanced technologies, techniques, and materials. Peeking inside the pocket, cherenkov-esque radiation illuminates a mass of materials and supplies. The mass inside this one does not appear to end.
ent-WFAdminTechHealthAnalyzer = subspace health analyzer
    .desc = A hand-held body scanner able to distinguish vital signs of the subject with high accuracy.
ent-WFAdminTechMultitool = subspace multitool
    .desc = An administrative-grade multitool.
ent-WFAdminTechPocketBluespace = bluespace pocket
    .desc = An artisinally crafted pocket liner utilizing advanced technologies, techniques, and materials.
ent-WFAdminTechPocketSubspace = subspace pocket
    .desc = An artisinally crafted pocket liner utilizing advanced technologies, techniques, and materials. This advanced version fills you with a sense of dread when you open it and peer inside.
ent-WFAdminTechPouch = subspace pouch
    .desc = Click to open the pouch.
ent-WFAdminTechRped = subspace rped
    .desc = A specialized bluespace RPED for technicians.
ent-WFAdminTechTankFrezon = frezon subspace tank
    .desc = A palm-sized gas tank embedded with an ominous purple crystal. There is a warning label indicating the tank should contain frezon.
ent-WFAdminTechTankNitrogen = nitrogen subspace tank
    .desc = A palm-sized gas tank embedded with an ominous purple crystal. There is a standardized internals information label showing the tank should contain nitrogen.
ent-WFAdminTechTankOxygen = oxygen subspace tank
    .desc = A palm-sized gas tank embedded with an ominous purple crystal. There is a standardized internals information label showing the tank should contain oxygen.
ent-WFAdminTechTankPlasma = plasma subspace tank
    .desc = A palm-sized gas tank embedded with an ominous purple crystal. There is a standardized internals information label showing the tank should contain plasma.
ent-WFAdminTechTankTritium = tritium subspace tank
    .desc = A palm-sized gas tank embedded with an ominous purple crystal. There is a warning label indicating the tank should contain tritium.
